re the first link, not buried at the bottom.","w":[31.405,31.587,31.828,32.07,32.251,32.734,32.855,33.036,33.338,33.519,34.002,34.123,34.364,34.787,35.089,35.27,35.451,35.693,35.814,36.116,36.237,36.357,36.72,36.901,37.324,37.444,37.807,38.109,38.411,38.773,38.894,39.014],"p":[[4,"💬","State the commission","do"],[18,"⬆️","Place near top","do"],[28,"🙈","Never bury it","no"]]},{"t0":39.753,"t1":47.048,"d":"On social media: Use #ad or #affiliate in a visible position (not hidden in a wall of hashtags).","w":[39.778,40.011,40.553,41.172,41.559,41.792,42.024,42.798,43.031,43.263,43.883,44.502,44.889,45.354,45.586,45.819,46.206,46.361],"p":[[9,"👀","Visible position","do"],[17,"🧱","Avoid hashtag walls","no"]]},{"t0":47.288,"t1":52.051,"d":"On YouTube: Say it verbally in the first 30 seconds AND add it to the description.","w":[47.312,47.501,48.004,48.255,48.381,48.883,49.072,49.198,49.575,49.952,50.454,50.643,50.831,50.957,51.146,51.271],"p":[[4,"🎙️","Disclose aloud early","do"],[15,"📄","Add to description","do"]]},{"t0":52.291,"t1":55.569,"d":"On TikTok: Use the built-in branded content toggle.","w":[52.316,52.501,53.058,53.368,53.491,53.986,54.481,55.038],"p":[[7,"🎛️","Branded content toggle","do"]]}],"ic":"⚖️"},{"kind":"point","label":null,"heading":"What Counts as Disclosure","t0":56.189,"t1":74.609,"sents":[{"t0":56.189,"t1":57.613,"d":"\"I earn a commission\" — clear.","w":[56.215,56.364,56.563,56.712,57.11,57.259],"p":[[5,"✅","Clear wording","key"]]},{"t0":57.853,"t1":59.489,"d":"\"Affiliate link\" — clear enough.","w":[57.875,58.415,58.685,58.846,59.116],"p":[[4,"👍","Acceptable wording","key"]]},{"t0":59.729,"t1":62.473,"d":"\"Sponsored\" — only if it's actually a sponsorship.","w":[59.764,60.238,60.396,60.713,60.818,60.976,61.503,61.662],"p":[[7,"🏷️","Only true sponsorships","key"]]},{"t0":62.713,"t1":65.554,"d":"\"Thanks to [brand]\" — too vague, doesn't indicate payment.","w":[62.793,63.1,63.254,63.561,63.714,63.919,64.175,64.533,65.045],"p":[[5,"🌫️","Too vague","no"]]},{"t0":65.794,"t1":70.146,"d":"A tiny disclaimer at the bottom of a page nobody reads — not sufficient.","w":[65.816,65.99,66.339,66.921,67.038,67.154,67.562,67.678,67.853,68.202,68.726,69.075,69.25,69.541],"p":[[2,"🔬","Fine print fails","no"]]},{"t0":70.386,"t1":74.609,"d":"The disclosure needs to be where someone would actually see it before clicking your link.","w":[70.415,70.52,71.044,71.358,71.515,71.725,71.935,72.301,72.511,73.035,73.244,73.349,73.716,74.083,74.24],"p":[[5,"📍","Visible placement","do"],[11,"⏱️","Before the click","key"]]}],"ic":"🏷️"},{"kind":"point","label":null,"heading":"Platform-Specific Rules","t0":75.229,"t1":96.923,"sents":[{"t0":75.229,"t1":80.014,"d":"Each platform also has its own rules on top of FTC requirements.","w":[75.25,75.572,76.214,76.663,76.92,77.113,77.369,77.755,77.947,78.268,78.397,79.103],"p":[[1,"📋","Platform rules too","key"]]},{"t0":80.254,"t1":82.72,"d":"Amazon bans affiliate links in emails.","w":[80.276,80.796,81.084,81.662,82.008,82.182],"p":[[1,"✉️","Email links banned","no"]]},{"t0":82.96,"t1":87.056,"d":"Instagram requires the \"Paid Partnership\" tag for sponsored posts.","w":[82.976,83.674,84.245,84.372,84.689,85.451,85.704,85.958,86.529],"p":[[0,"📸","Paid Partnership tag","do"]]},{"t0":87.296,"t1":90.342,"d":"YouTube has a \"includes paid promotion\" checkbox.","w":[87.319,87.801,88.043,88.223,88.766,89.067,89.67],"p":[[6,"☑️","Tick the checkbox","do"]]},{"t0":90.582,"t1":92.646,"d":"TikTok has branded content tools.","w":[90.606,91.094,91.311,91.745,92.233],"p":[[2,"🎬","Branded content tools","key"]]},{"t0":92.886,"t1":96.923,"d":"Know the rules for every platform you use — ignorance isn't a defense.","w":[92.912,93.146,93.264,93.615,93.85,94.143,94.729,94.905,95.198,95.374,95.901,96.253,96.429],"p":[[9,"🙉","No ignorance defense","no"]]}],"ic":"📱"},{"kind":"point","label":null,"heading":"Don't Overthink It","t0":97.543,"t1":118.15,"sents":[{"t0":97.543,"t1":99.626,"d":"Disclosure doesn't kill conversions.","w":[97.565,98.18,98.61,98.855],"p":[[3,"📈","No conversion penalty","key"]]},{"t0":99.866,"t1":101.404,"d":"People appreciate honesty.","w":[99.89,100.26,100.893],"p":[[2,"💙","Honesty is valued","key"]]},{"t0":101.644,"t1":108.617,"d":"A simple \"I use affiliate links — if you buy through them I earn a small commission at no extra cost to you\" is enough.","w":[101.668,101.85,102.277,102.459,102.764,103.373,103.738,103.921,104.043,104.226,104.469,104.774,105.017,105.2,105.443,105.626,105.992,106.479,106.601,106.844,107.27,107.575,107.758,107.94,108.062],"p":[[1,"✍️","Keep it simple","do"],[24,"👌","Short is enough","key"]]},{"t0":108.857,"t1":114.97,"d":"Many top affiliates have found that transparent disclosure actually increases trust and conversions.","w":[108.88,109.189,109.499,110.18,110.428,110.799,111.047,111.789,112.408,113.028,113.647,114.018,114.204],"p":[[10,"🤝","Boosts trust","key"]]},{"t0":115.21,"t1":118.15,"d":"Just be upfront and move on to the valuable content.","w":[115.246,115.559,115.768,116.184,116.341,116.601,116.758,116.914,117.018,117.591],"p":[[2,"🎤","Disclose then deliver","do"]]}],"ic":"⚖️"}],"take":"Disclose affiliate links clearly, every time."}